    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      387.19,
      286.44,
      473.83
    ],
    "text": "I, hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7, of the Land Acquisition Act as Amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following land /servitude* which is required for a public purpose :- Description of the land or servitude to be acquired :",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.9994001388549805,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      475.28,
      286.41,
      542.72
    ],
    "text": "Under mentioned allotments of land in extent 0.1316 in the surveyor General\u2019s final Village Plan No. 472 (Additional No. 21) situated in Battuwangala in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division Neluwa in the Galle.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      544.16,
      286.42,
      594.56
    ],
    "text": "1. Lot No. 770 Name of the land: Kurunduwaththa; Description: Scrub Jungle; Extent : 2.8330 Hectares.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.039495944976807,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      345.68,
      539.44,
      470.72
    ],
    "text": "All Persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands on which a servitude is to be Acquired are hereby required to appear personally or by agents duly authorized in writing before me at Neluwa Divisional Secretariat on the 16th of May 2018 at 10.00 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 02nd day of May 2018 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land/servitude the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
